---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <header class="header">
    <div class="wrap header-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Battaglia Navale — home">
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">⚓</span>
        <span>Battaglia Navale</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Principale">
        <a href="#gioco">Gioco</a>
        <a href="#avvio">Avvio</a>
        <a href="#tech">Stack</a>
        <a class="nav-cta" href={siteConfig.githubRepo} rel="noopener noreferrer">
          GitHub
        </a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="contenuto">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Open source · MIT · Python 3.10+</p>
          <h1>La battaglia navale che vive nel terminale</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            Due giocatori, una partita sincronizzata via TCP, griglie interattive con frecce e
            Invio. Un solo file Python, nessuna dipendenza da installare: ideale in locale o in LAN.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn primary" href={siteConfig.githubRepo}>Clona il repository</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="#avvio">Come si avvia</a>
          </div>
          <ul class="hero-stats" aria-label="Caratteristiche principali">
            <li><strong>0</strong> pacchetti pip</li>
            <li><strong>10×10</strong> griglia A–J</li>
            <li><strong>2</strong> giocatori TCP</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <aside class="hero-board" aria-label="Anteprima griglia">
          <div class="board-frame">
            <p class="board-title">Avversario</p>
            <pre class="board mono" aria-hidden="true"><span class="dim">   A B C D E F G H I J</span>
<span class="dim"> 1</span> ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~
<span class="dim"> 2</span> ~ ~ <span class="miss">○</span> ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~
<span class="dim"> 3</span> ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~
<span class="dim"> 4</span> ~ ~ ~ <span class="hit">✖</span> ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~
<span class="dim"> 5</span> ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~
<span class="dim"> 6</span> ~ <span class="hit">✖</span> ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~
<span class="dim"> 7</span> ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~
<span class="dim"> 8</span> ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~</pre>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="gioco" class="section">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Come funziona la partita</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">
          Il server tiene lo stato autoritativo; ogni client invia comandi JSON e disegna le
          proprie tavole. Prima si piazza la flotta, poi si alternano gli spari fino alla vittoria.
        </p>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>
            <h3>Avvia il server</h3>
            <p>Dal menu o con <code>python3 battaglia_navale.py server</code>. Default
              <code>127.0.0.1:5555</code>, oppure <code>0.0.0.0</code> per la LAN.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Connetti due terminali</h3>
            <p>Due client sulla stessa porta: il primo è giocatore 1, il secondo giocatore 2.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Piazza e combatti</h3>
            <p>Flotta 4-3-3-2-2-2-1×4. Frecce, Invio, <kbd>R</kbd> per ruotare, <kbd>A</kbd> per
              posizione casuale.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section features">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Perché questo progetto</h2>
        <div class="cards">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Monolite chiaro</h3>
            <p>Tutta la logica in <code>battaglia_navale.py</code>: server, client, menu e TUI. Facile
              da leggere e da modificare.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Rete semplice</h3>
            <p>Protocollo line-delimited JSON su TCP. Nessun WebSocket, nessun broker: due socket e
              una partita in memoria.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Terminale curato</h3>
            <p>Curses quando disponibile, fallback su TTY raw. Colori, riquadri Unicode e doppia
              griglia se lo schermo è largo abbastanza.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Documentazione</h3>
            <p>README per l’uso rapido, <code>DATASHEET.md</code> per architettura, protocollo e
              comportamento del server.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="avvio" class="section code-section">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Avvio rapido</h2>
        <div class="code-grid">
          <figure>
            <figcaption>Linux / macOS</figcaption>
            <pre class="code mono"><code>git clone {siteConfig.githubRepo}.git
cd battaglia-navale
chmod +x avvia.sh
./avvia.sh</code></pre>
          </figure>
          <figure>
            <figcaption>Windows</figcaption>
            <pre class="code mono"><code>git clone {siteConfig.githubRepo}.git
cd battaglia-navale
avvia.bat</code></pre>
          </figure>
          <figure>
            <figcaption>Solo terminale</figcaption>
            <pre class="code mono"><code>python3 battaglia_navale.py server
python3 battaglia_navale.py client 127.0.0.1 5555</code></pre>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="tech" class="section">
      <div class="wrap narrow">
        <h2>Stack tecnico</h2>
        <dl class="spec">
          <div><dt>Linguaggio</dt><dd>Python 3.10+ (stdlib)</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Trasporto</dt><dd>TCP, messaggi JSON + newline</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Concorrenza server</dt><dd>Thread per giocatore, lock su <code>Partita</code></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Piattaforme</dt><dd>Linux, macOS, Windows</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Licenza</dt><dd>MIT</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="wrap footer-inner">
      <p>
        <span>{siteConfig.name}</span> — {siteConfig.author}, 2026 ·
        <a href={siteConfig.githubRepo}>Sorgente su GitHub</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .wrap {
    width: min(1120px, 100% - 2rem);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .narrow {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 50;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.12);
    background: rgba(7, 19, 34, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  }

  .header-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 0;
  }

  .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: #f0f9ff;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .brand-mark {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .nav a {
    color: #94a3b8;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .nav a:hover {
    color: #e0f2fe;
  }

  .nav-cta {
    color: #22d3ee !important;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 4rem 0 5rem;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    }
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #22d3ee;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.85rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #f8fafc;
  }

  .lead {
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    max-width: 36em;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }

  .btn.primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9, #0284c7);
    color: #042033;
  }

  .btn.primary:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.08);
  }

  .btn.ghost {
    border-color: rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.35);
    color: #e0f2fe;
  }

  .btn.ghost:hover {
    background: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.1);
  }

  .hero-stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.5rem 2.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .hero-stats strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #7dd3fc;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .hero-board {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .board-frame {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.2);
    background: rgba(12, 42, 69, 0.5);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }

  .board-title {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .board {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .dim {
    color: #475569;
  }

  .hit {
    color: #f87171;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .miss {
    color: #fbbf24;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 4rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);
  }

  .section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #f1f5f9;
  }

  .section-intro {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    max-width: 42em;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  .steps {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .steps {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .steps li {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(15, 40, 65, 0.45);
    border: 1px solid rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.1);
  }

  .steps h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: #e0f2fe;
  }

  .steps p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  .steps code {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: #7dd3fc;
  }

  .features {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .cards {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .cards {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.15);
    background: rgba(7, 19, 34, 0.6);
  }

  .card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: #bae6fd;
  }

  .card p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  .card code {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: #67e8f9;
  }

  .code-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .code-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .code-grid figure {
    margin: 0;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #64748b;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .code {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    overflow-x: auto;
    background: #020617;
    border: 1px solid rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.8);
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .spec {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .spec div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 9rem 1fr;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);
  }

  .spec dt {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .spec dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .spec code {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: #67e8f9;
  }

  kbd {
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    background: rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.8);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .footer {
    padding: 2rem 0 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);
  }

  .footer-inner p {
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .footer a {
    color: #22d3ee;
  }
</style>
